/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()

# Mirrors cire/web's baseline: framing (X-Frame-Options + frame-ancestors),
# MIME-sniffing (nosniff), and referrer protections for the higher-privilege
# organiser portal (session cookie for the whole account, full guest lists).
#
# Deliberately NO restrictive `script-src`/`connect-src` CSP here yet. The
# portal now talks to one origin only (cire/api — sign-in is a top-level
# redirect to musubi, not a fetch), so a locked-down policy is finally within
# reach; writing and testing it is a tracked follow-up (S-L1) — see
# cire/wiki/todo/security.md.
